Package: lipdverseUpdater
Title: Database Update Pipeline for the LiPDverse
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nicholas", "McKay", email = "nick@nau.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ingests, validates, standardizes, versions and exports the
    LiPDverse database: a collection of LiPD files organized into partially
    overlapping compilations. Replaces the update half of lipdverseR with
    explicit stage contracts, a versioned QC store, transactional writes and
    a canonical Parquet export. Website generation is out of scope.
